WEBVTT

00:09:57.116 --> 00:10:00.045
and because I love my country, I'm doing this.

00:10:00.045 --> 00:10:02.910
Because I believe a society will not be free

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.453
if the women of that society are not free.

00:10:05.453 --> 00:10:15.382
(Applause)

00:10:15.382 --> 00:10:17.734
Thank you.

00:10:17.734 --> 00:10:20.550
(Applause)

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.174
Thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:10:23.174 --> 00:10:35.938
(Applause)